post-it: CD-tray keeps on opening and closing
cause: Virus started from StartUp
symptoms:
	Slow computer
	Acts strangely
	Programs won't start
checks:
	yes: CD tray opens and closes by itself
		shows: every few seconds while Windows runs
	yes: Unknown program in StartUp
		shows: BIZOPP.EXE, from C:\WINDOWS
software steps:
	Get the CompuFun AntiVirus floppy from storage
	Put it in drive A: and run SETUP.EXE
	Run CompuFun AntiVirus, scan, and Clean what it finds
notes:
	Broken part: OS
